| Hunt 1: T1087.001 - Local Account Discovery
| Author: Wamba José
| Logic: 3+ distinct account discovery commands within 5 minutes

index=endpoint source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(Image="*\\net.exe" OR Image="*\\net1.exe" OR Image="*\\whoami.exe" OR Image="*\\cmdkey.exe")
| bin _time span=5m
| stats count dc(CommandLine) as distinct_cmds values(CommandLine) as commands by _time host User ParentImage
| where distinct_cmds >= 3
